# The place-page route, iterated — the one the other soaks cannot reach.
#
# It needs all three: `-maps-mock-semantic-clusters` for hierarchy markers to
# exist at all, `-maps-country-region` because at the default framing there are
# NONE (the city and country bands only activate at a wider viewport) and at the
# city band the single one wears a TEXT face and so carries no place page, and
# the soak's own alternating close axis, because only a VERTICAL close lands on
# the page.
#
# Measured on this configuration: 6 cycles over 4 hierarchy markers, two of them
# landing on the page and popping home, 0 stuck, 0 failures, and the census back
# to `drivers=0 controllers=0` at rest.
CASE_ARGS=(-rich-media -maps-mock-semantic-clusters -maps-country-region -maps-soak 6)
CASE_DURATION=150
CASE_CHECKS=(audit duty-cycle)
